===Etymology 2===
{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Crying-girl.jpg|thumb|A child producing '''tears'''.]]

From {{inh|en|enm|teer|id=tear|t=tear}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tēar}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*tahr}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*tahrą||tear}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dáḱru-||tears}}.

Cognates include {{cog|non|tár}} ({{cog|da|tåre}} and {{cog|no|tåre}}), {{cog|goh|zahar}} ({{cog|de|Zähre}}), {{cog|got|𐍄𐌰𐌲𐍂}}, {{cog|ga|deoir}} and {{cog|la|lacrima}}.

